{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Allow artistic swimming as a GCSE and A-level option for PE coursework.",
        "additional_details": "Artistic (formerly synchronised) swimming has elements of dance, cheerleading, gymnastics, & swimming - all in PE curriculums. \r\nAthletes possess precision, endurance, flexibility & coordination, all while performing intricate routines in water. \r\nWe are as passionate about artistic swimming as many are about football, netball, or athletics.\r\nRecognising artistic swimming validates hard work & promotes inclusivity & diversification within sport curriculums.\r\nSign to help make it an option for PE.",
        "background": "Current coursework options for GCSE and A-Level PE include many options, but do not recognise Artistic Swimming as one, even though it is a skilled Olympic sport.\r\n\r\nNot having it as an option prevents artistic swimmers from being able to count their specialist sport as part of their skills.",
